            "review_title": "Review at Cuong Ky Mi Gia 157",
            "review_text": "jwidjj\nJakarta, Indonesia731 contributions\n0\nDelicious sui ciao egg noodle in Chinatown\nNov 2022 • Friends\nHad lunch here to celebrate a friend's birthday. The noodle is just the nice texture, not too soft and not too hard. The accompanying sui ciao (bigger version of wontons) were big and tasteful. The filling was minced pork and shrimp. Pork broth soup with pork ribs were served free of charge The servers were courteous, speak Mandarin and Cantonese as this humble restaurant is located in Saigon's Chinatown. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nWritten November 28, 2022",
